:name: VoltDragon with a real ground station link
:description: Both nodes, with Node B's Ethernet bridged to a TAP interface on the host.
:
: Linux only, and Renode needs permission to create the TAP device (run it as
: root, or create tap0 beforehand with your user as owner). Then, on the host:
:
:   sudo ip addr add 192.168.10.1/24 dev tap0
:   sudo ip link set tap0 up
:   python -m ground_station.receiver
:   python -m ground_station.command TLM_RATE 20
:
: Wireshark on tap0 shows the telemetry broadcasts and command exchanges.
: For a flight with the plant model driving the sensors, use: python -m sim.mission --tap

include $ORIGIN/system.resc
include $ORIGIN/tap_link.resc

start
